return {
    ["\n我叫康修娜，是书店的店员，我的工作是站在门口朝大家微笑。\n\n我的脸有点笑僵了，所以我决定写点东西。\n\n今天英森特还是那副懒样子，只会抱怨书店生意不好。\n\n唉，快点到吃午饭的时间吧……午饭？我吃过……午饭吗？"] = "\nMy name is Kangxiuna, I'm a clerk at the bookstore, and my job is to stand at the door and smile at everyone.\n\nMy face is a bit stiff from smiling, so I decided to write something.\n\nToday, Inset is still that lazy self, only complaining that the bookstore business is bad.\n\nSigh, hurry up to lunchtime... lunch? Have I eaten... lunch?",
