    ["68级6人本Boss困难"] = "Level 68 6-Player Dungeon Boss Hard",
    ["<InvDefault>1.因“非凡之路，感谢同行”福利计划，我们本周新增了【零元购凭证】的更多获取途径，修改内容如下：</>\n<InvDefault>【神降惊喜礼盒福利加码】</>\n<InvDefault>1）新增奖励内容：原秘宝箱子中获取的</><InvHighlight>神降惊喜礼盒稀有概率不变，新增了零元购凭证、多种金镑代金券奖励类型</><InvDefault>，且未获得稀有奖励时必定获得一定数量的绑定苏勒。</>\n<InvDefault>2）修改开启方式：</><InvHighlight>神降惊喜礼盒从默认自动开启修改为需手动确认开启</><InvDefault>。</>\n<InvDefault>3）我们将为符合情况的对应非凡者，发送本周已开启的神降惊喜礼盒对应数量的新增奖励礼盒，包括：概率获取的零元购凭证、多种金镑代金券和一定数量的绑定苏勒，之后将通过邮件形式发放，请非凡者关注后续邮件。</>\n<InvDefault>2.【剧情】</>\n<InvDefault>1）修复了特殊情况下，达到指定等级未正常开启主线任务的问题。</>\n<InvDefault>2）修复了现实主线《廷根守护者》中部分步骤黑屏时间过长的问题。</>\n<InvDefault>3）修复了特殊情况下现实主线《暗涌的危机》中无法找到伦纳德、弗莱的问题。</>\n<InvDefault>4）优化了部分主线动画的跳过节奏。</>\n<InvDefault>3.【副本】</>\n<InvDefault>1）下调了副本【黑荆棘事件簿·黄金之罪】中“洛克·金”骗局陷阱和债务之护机制处理失败后的技能伤害。</>\n<InvDefault>2）下调了副本【乌托邦剧院】困难和噩梦难度下，双人模式中怪物的伤害。</>\n<InvDefault>4.优化了【座驾】中车辆【留声机】的播放规则，若下车前已经暂停或者关闭留声机，再次上车会记录留声机状态，不会默认播放。</>\n<InvDefault>5.修复了【廷根】的【马车】和【骑警】的音效问题以及移动表现问题。</>\n<InvDefault>6.修复了特殊情况下，【原著瞬间】等【秩序世界】玩法物件消失无法交互，导致玩法无法完成的问题，非凡者可以回到原点位正常完成玩法。</>\n<InvDefault>7.修复了学徒技能【记录】和【漫游】在网络波动环境下触发异常的问题。</>"] = "<InvDefault>1. As part of the ‘Path of the Beyonder, Thank You for the Journey’ benefit program, more ways to obtain 【Zero-Cost Vouchers】 have been added this week, with the following changes:</>\n<InvDefault>【Divine Descent Surprise Gift Box Bonus】</>\n<InvDefault>1）New rewards: the original Treasure Chest's </><InvHighlight>rare-drop rate for Divine Descent Surprise Gift Boxes is unchanged, while Zero-Cost Vouchers and several pound-voucher reward types have been added</><InvDefault>. A quantity of bound soli is guaranteed whenever no rare reward is obtained.</>\n<InvDefault>2）Opening method changed: </><InvHighlight>Divine Descent Surprise Gift Boxes now require manual confirmation instead of opening automatically by default</><InvDefault>.</>\n<InvDefault>3）Eligible Beyonders will receive additional reward boxes matching the number of Divine Descent Surprise Gift Boxes opened this week. These may grant Zero-Cost Vouchers, several kinds of pound vouchers, and a quantity of bound soli. They will be delivered by mail; please watch for future messages.</>\n<InvDefault>2.【Story】</>\n<InvDefault>1）Fixed the main quest not starting normally upon reaching the required level under special circumstances.</>\n<InvDefault>2）Fixed excessively long black screens during some steps of the real-world main quest 《Guardian of Tingen》.</>\n<InvDefault>3）Fixed Leonard and Frye being impossible to find under special circumstances in the real-world main quest 《Undercurrent Crisis》.</>\n<InvDefault>4）Improved the Skip pacing of some main-story cinematics.</>\n<InvDefault>3.【Dungeons】</>\n<InvDefault>1）Reduced skill damage after failing the Locke King scam-trap and Debt Protection mechanics in 【Blackthorn Casebook · Sin of Gold】.</>\n<InvDefault>2）Reduced monster damage in two-player mode on Hard and Nightmare difficulties in 【Utopia Theatre】.</>\n<InvDefault>4. Improved the playback rules for the 【Gramophone】 vehicle feature under 【Mounts】. If the gramophone was paused or switched off before dismounting, its state is now remembered when mounting again instead of playback starting automatically.</>\n<InvDefault>5. Fixed sound and movement issues affecting 【Carriages】 and 【Mounted Police】 in 【Tingen】.</>\n<InvDefault>6. Fixed 【World of Order】 objects such as 【Original-Story Moments】 disappearing and becoming non-interactive under special circumstances, preventing completion. Beyonders can now return to the original location and finish normally.</>\n<InvDefault>7. Fixed abnormal triggering of the Apprentice skills 【Record】 and 【Wander】 during network instability.</>",
